  "chapter": 94,
  "sortOrder": 19094,
  "verseCount": 23,
  "aliases": [
    "Psalm",
    "Psalms",
    "Ps",
    "Psa",
    "Psm"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "O Lord God, to whom vengeance belongeth; O God, to whom vengeance belongeth, shew thyself.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Lift up thyself, thou judge of the earth: render a reward to the proud.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "LORD, how long shall the wicked, how long shall the wicked triumph?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "How long shall they utter and speak hard things? and all the workers of iniquity boast themselves?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "They break in pieces thy people, O LORD, and afflict thine heritage.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "They slay the widow and the stranger, and murder the fatherless.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Yet they say, The LORD shall not see, neither shall the God of Jacob regard it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Understand, ye brutish among the people: and ye fools, when will ye be wise?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "He that planted the ear, shall he not hear? he that formed the eye, shall he not see?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "He that chastiseth the heathen, shall not he correct? he that teacheth man knowledge, shall not he know?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "The LORD knoweth the thoughts of man, that they are vanity.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "Blessed is the man whom thou chastenest, O LORD, and teachest him out of thy law;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "That thou mayest give him rest from the days of adversity, until the pit be digged for the wicked.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "For the LORD will not cast off his people, neither will he forsake his inheritance.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "But judgment shall return unto righteousness: and all the upright in heart shall follow it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "Who will rise up for me against the evildoers? or who will stand up for me against the workers of iniquity?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "Unless the LORD had been my help, my soul had almost dwelt in silence.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "When I said, My foot slippeth; thy mercy, O LORD, held me up.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "In the multitude of my thoughts within me thy comforts delight my soul.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "Shall the throne of iniquity have fellowship with thee, which frameth mischief by a law?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "They gather themselves together against the soul of the righteous, and condemn the innocent blood.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "But the LORD is my defence; and my God is the rock of my refuge.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:94:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "And he shall bring upon them their own iniquity, and shall cut them off in their own wickedness; yea, the LORD our God shall cut them off.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 94:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:94:23"
      }
    }
  ],
